Why do you believe?

I mean, I believe in this man
But I don't believe in God.

He believes in something he doesn't believe;
I believe in a man who's had his heart broken
And has been unable to heal.

But he doesn't see it that way;
He's not so sure.

He doesn't know if God exists;
He doesn't know if this world exists;
He doesn't know if God lives alone;

